title The row that cost nothing at all, and a banner still naming the room its file had left
prompt Read KYRI and RADIANT_STYLE first, then REMEMBER, then the itineraries and the top three rows of session-logs/README.md; Standfast on reds; take the next agent-doable lap Lindy-first crux-first; deep-read one council-rota row; send often.
think Read context/KYRI.md and context/RADIANT_STYLE.md before anything else, then crux/REMEMBER.md and the top three rows of session-logs/README.md. The running thread is the Caravan ladder lift arc, and the newest recommend named reclaim_notes as the honest lift -- the free head confer_words at 294 costs forty-three import re-exports where reclaim_notes returns the same 294 costing nothing at all.
think Standfast first. An awk pass over crux/REDS.md matched every REDS %N heading against a REDS %N CLOSED counterpart and found no row lacking one -- 147 rows, every one closed. The constructive queue was honestly open.
think Council rota row 3 -- Water/Venus, care and flow: Gall's Law, the happy zone and the thin edge, growing a language. Gall reads directly onto this arc: ladder_checks.rye was never designed as an eleven-thousand-line harness, it grew one lifted body at a time from a rung that already ran, which is the law's own shape.
think Ran the queue mode of ladder_reach_visibility_scan.sh rather than trusting the prior lap's row. reclaim_notes stood at fall=294 folding=43 lines=10 stub=3 with widens, widens_fn, and widens_const all zero -- the only row on the board free by every column the meter keeps.
think Hashed all forty-three bodies declaring the name before lifting. All forty-three identical, byte for byte, and all forty-three already pub -- so the stub publishes nothing new, which is what widens=0 says in words. reclaim_one in the harness already reaches rung.reclaim_notes, so the name had to stay published either way.
think Seated the lifted body directly above the reclaim_one that calls it, since reclaim_one is the only caller in the harness and the notes writer belongs beside the reclamation it serves. The seating is an argument rather than an alphabetization.
think Carry fell 58,838 -> 58,544, a fall of 294 -- the scan's predicted number to the digit, thirteen laps running. Lowered both ceilings together, the witness assert and the scan's CEILING default.
think Rotated the reach witness pins. reclaim_notes left the queue, so its queue-row assert became rests_path at 250 -- the new best row costing nothing of any kind -- and the widest-standing-family block retargeted to confer_words, which reads declared=44 identical=43 and so shows the visibility split REDS %144 seated. Added reclaim_notes to the folded regression window at fall=0.
think The sink window fell with the lift, 63,956 -> 63,655 total and 62,816 -> 62,515 above the line, farewell holding 3,684 -> 3,677. A lifted body leaves the rungs rather than the harness, so both windows move together.
obs The finding worth carrying is what "free" turned out to mean. The queue prices two columns -- widens_fn and widens_const -- and calls a row free when both read zero, which named confer_words as the free head at forty-three import re-exports. reclaim_notes returned the identical 294 over the identical forty-three rungs and cost nothing at all, since every rung declaring it already imports ladder_checks for the stubs standing beside it. So an import re-export is free by measurement rather than by definition, and this row is the first of the arc where the two readings of free agree absolutely rather than merely agreeing in rank.
obs The second observation is a docs-sync ratchet the rota itself surfaced. growing-a-language.md carries a banner reading "re-seated from yonder/ to active-designing/" while the file has lived in foundations/ since its 20260821.211423 graduation, and its Status still read Active Design. Both repointed on touch, with the graduation named and the earlier re-seating kept as the record it is. Second lap running that reading a rota document found its own banner one room behind -- single-stranded.md was the same shape last lap, which makes it a lantern that has now fired twice.
obs Every gate GREEN on metal at a cold start: Caravan choir at 108, tame_style_check bans clean, width-check clean, caravan_ladder_copy_witness, living_docs_lint, radiant_negation_witness. No Brushstroke behavior moved.
