file tools/caravan_ladder_carry_witness.rish both carry asserts lowered together and the fold-queue narrative rewritten for this lap's family
file tools/caravan_ladder_reach_visibility_witness.rish pins rotated -- rests_path took the free-absolutely row, confer_words took the widest-standing block, reclaim_notes joined the folded window, sink and farewell numbers moved with the lift
file foundations/20260618-184912_growing-a-language.md banner repointed from active-designing to foundations and Status raised to Living, a docs-sync ratchet the council rota surfaced
recommend keep-going rests_path leads the free-absolutely reading at 250 over eleven rungs of a twenty-eight-line body, widening nothing of any kind; confer_words holds the queue's own free head at 294 over forty-three rungs priced at forty-three import re-exports, and answered_by still leads by return at 330 costing sixty-eight openings. Beside the arc, the banner found one room behind its file is now the second of its kind in two laps, so the standing-equipment question REDS %147 opened has a companion: a meter that reports when each living document's own Status and room banner last agreed with where the file actually sits.
